# Wild Card

- Use real client photos only. No stock photos, no illustrations, no unDraw.
- No walls of text. Paragraphs are 35 words or fewer. Lists of 3 or more items become cards, chips, icons, or a table.
- One hero headline of 8 words or fewer, with one primary call to action.
- Home uses at least 3 different layout types.
- Mobile navigation works: hidden until the menu button opens it, and links are tappable.
- Target Baseline Widely available. Anchor positioning only with a position fallback.
- Never show stock or availability badges, or fact-check notes, on the page.
- Keep live URLs and paths.
